WEBVTT

00:02.020 --> 00:05.930
Ayako-san and I ended up going to Masaki-san’s lab.

00:06.490 --> 00:09.540
The Student Council President says he’ll come with us.

00:10.360 --> 00:11.660
I know it’ll be OK!

00:11.660 --> 00:14.570
Ayako’s beatrice will come back.

00:14.570 --> 00:18.730
I also promised Itsumi that I’d protect her.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:57.970 --> 02:00.540
Ayako-san, how are you feeling?

02:02.610 --> 02:06.180
The beatrice’s confusion has stopped.

02:06.180 --> 02:08.480
I’m actually feeling fine.

02:08.480 --> 02:12.480
It’s been six days since you lost your beatrice ability?

02:13.010 --> 02:14.990
We need to get it back soon.

02:14.990 --> 02:16.120
Yeah.

02:16.120 --> 02:17.060
OK!

02:17.060 --> 02:22.440
Let’s have thirty-nine banzais to see you off!

02:23.230 --> 02:25.930
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai...

02:25.930 --> 02:28.400
Thirty-nine?

02:28.400 --> 02:31.460
We... We have to get going now.

02:31.990 --> 02:33.560
Agreed.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.810
Come on, Mamoru.

02:34.810 --> 02:35.310
Right!

02:35.310 --> 02:46.520
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

02:47.200 --> 02:49.350
Jeez, they make such a big deal out of this.

02:49.350 --> 02:53.550
Well, they came all the way here for us.

02:54.350 --> 02:55.260
That’s...

03:00.680 --> 03:04.910
Bye!

03:03.700 --> 03:04.900
Good luck!

03:06.860 --> 03:09.580
I’ve brought your meal.

03:10.120 --> 03:12.460
Oh, thank... You!

03:16.530 --> 03:17.850
Emelenzia!

03:17.850 --> 03:20.090
What are you doing here?

03:20.680 --> 03:22.010
Witch Beatrice!

03:22.010 --> 03:24.570
Eat lots of meat.

03:24.570 --> 03:26.190
Stamina first.

03:26.190 --> 03:27.580
Morale second.

03:27.580 --> 03:30.520
I’ll bring chestnut meat buns for your three o’clock snack.

03:31.640 --> 03:35.810
You need to eat fish. You’re growing up.

03:37.300 --> 03:38.790
Hey, wait...

03:43.280 --> 03:46.710
I have no idea what you’re saying.

03:49.620 --> 03:54.670
Return to the Beginning

03:58.670 --> 04:00.930
Yes, we’re almost at the airport.

04:01.710 --> 04:03.970
Once I’ve gotten Ayako, I’ll...

04:18.520 --> 04:21.100
No one’s here.

04:21.100 --> 04:22.810
That’s strange.

04:22.810 --> 04:25.340
Someone should have come to pick us up.

04:30.600 --> 04:31.620
I can’t get through.

04:35.650 --> 04:37.200
I’ve got a bad feeling.

04:41.390 --> 04:45.920
Bad feelings like this generally
come true with eighty percent accuracy.

04:58.500 --> 05:01.070
The wind feels good.

05:01.070 --> 05:02.290
Huh, Mamoru?

05:03.830 --> 05:05.860
Yes, Ayako-san.

05:05.860 --> 05:10.450
<i>Oh, no. Her hair was so beautiful,
I forgot myself for a second.</i>

05:11.230 --> 05:13.900
Masaki’s lab is up ahead.

05:14.580 --> 05:17.670
Thirty minutes, I think.

05:17.670 --> 05:21.640
Last year, it was on university grounds.

05:21.640 --> 05:23.740
Masaki’s gone up in the world.

05:27.230 --> 05:28.550
Is something wrong?

05:32.320 --> 05:34.170
Are you giving it to me?

05:38.190 --> 05:40.360
D-Danke schoen.

05:51.060 --> 05:52.300
This is strange...

05:53.490 --> 05:56.020
It’s been an hour, hasn’t it?

05:56.460 --> 05:57.810
Yes.

06:06.820 --> 06:09.740
Could it be that the Silver Maria is among those people?

06:10.620 --> 06:14.690
Emelenzia, is one of them the Silver Maria?

06:14.690 --> 06:16.830
Unfortunately, no.

06:16.830 --> 06:20.060
But I’ve heard she’s fairly old.

06:28.110 --> 06:29.820
Watch out, Mamoru!

06:33.870 --> 06:34.950
Mamoru!

06:34.950 --> 06:37.280
Mamoru, are you OK?

06:40.160 --> 06:43.740
You shouldn’t show your back to an enemy!

06:47.750 --> 06:49.300
Hello there!

06:49.740 --> 06:51.780
You can’t be...

06:51.780 --> 06:53.030
The Silver Maria!

06:55.160 --> 06:57.550
I can transform, you know.

06:57.550 --> 07:00.560
I choose my age based on how my skin looks.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.080
See?

07:01.080 --> 07:02.470
So fresh and new!

07:02.930 --> 07:06.230
Much smoother than yours!

07:17.700 --> 07:18.520
Mamoru!

07:19.750 --> 07:22.730
He can still stand up after that?

07:23.620 --> 07:26.250
You’re after me, right?!

07:26.250 --> 07:28.070
How dare you hurt Mamoru...

07:28.070 --> 07:29.690
Now, now.

07:29.690 --> 07:32.900
Even if you get mad, you still can’t use your beatrice.

07:34.920 --> 07:37.280
There’s no problem, Witch Beatrice.

07:37.910 --> 07:39.350
I’m here.

07:39.660 --> 07:42.250
For what it’s worth, I’m here, too.

07:46.410 --> 07:48.050
Fine.

07:48.050 --> 07:53.460
I was just gonna test you a little, and then I was gonna...

07:59.540 --> 08:03.500
But why not? I guess I’ll fight you for real.

08:12.240 --> 08:13.340
What?

08:21.650 --> 08:22.920
Johan!

08:29.430 --> 08:33.990
I didn’t expect you to appear right
at your enemy’s throat, Silver Maria.

08:34.930 --> 08:39.230
Oh my, Johan. You’re still a gentleman as ever.

08:39.230 --> 08:40.700
Johan, you...

08:40.700 --> 08:45.430
Witch Beatrice, we can enjoy our meeting later.

08:47.760 --> 08:50.710
I won’t let you touch my bride.

08:50.710 --> 08:52.720
I see.

08:52.720 --> 08:57.640
Then what about her dear boyfriend?

09:01.370 --> 09:01.960
Mamoru?

09:08.300 --> 09:09.230
Mamoru!

09:10.090 --> 09:14.370
Try anything, and bang!

09:14.370 --> 09:16.370
I don’t mind at all.

09:16.370 --> 09:20.060
I’ll bury you and Yoshimura Mamoru, as well.

09:20.060 --> 09:21.500
Johan...

09:21.500 --> 09:25.120
Brother, don’t! Please...

09:25.120 --> 09:26.650
Emelenzia...

09:26.650 --> 09:29.990
Mamoru has nothing to do with this!

09:29.990 --> 09:32.980
If you injure Mamoru to defeat the Silver Maria,

09:32.980 --> 09:35.730
it will hurt your pride.

09:37.200 --> 09:38.600
I see...

09:38.600 --> 09:39.530
I see.

09:40.230 --> 09:41.370
Brother...

09:42.390 --> 09:44.700
Now I want him dead even more.

09:45.520 --> 09:47.970
Johan, if you...

09:48.890 --> 09:50.500
Ayako, calm down!

09:50.500 --> 09:51.280
You’re still...

09:52.670 --> 09:54.780
Everyone, look over here!

09:55.750 --> 09:57.550
See you!

10:03.660 --> 10:05.420
Mamoru!

10:05.420 --> 10:07.020
M-Mamoru...

10:10.670 --> 10:12.930
Bye!

10:15.930 --> 10:17.420
Mamoru!

10:17.730 --> 10:21.380
Stop! We can’t catch up.

10:21.380 --> 10:24.330
No! Mamoru’s going to...

10:24.330 --> 10:25.910
Johan, do something!

10:25.910 --> 10:28.310
Calm down, Witch Beatrice.

10:28.310 --> 10:29.250
No!

10:32.630 --> 10:33.280
Ayako!

10:36.830 --> 10:38.340
What did you do?!

10:38.340 --> 10:40.370
She’s merely fallen unconscious.

10:40.370 --> 10:44.210
It’s not a good idea for her to use up any more strength.

10:44.210 --> 10:46.830
Ayako’s lost her beatrice!

10:46.830 --> 10:48.390
And you...

10:51.560 --> 10:55.530
Emelenzia, let Witch Beatrice lie down somewhere.

10:55.530 --> 10:56.490
Right.

11:17.410 --> 11:21.530
<i>How many times have I seen you asleep?</i>

11:22.730 --> 11:27.000
<i>Thinking back, you’ve been suffering and hurt each time.</i>

11:28.850 --> 11:37.590
<i>From now on, I’ll probably... I’ll probably
never see you sleeping happily.</i>

11:39.040 --> 11:45.010
<i>When you wake up, your first word will be “Mamoru.”</i>

11:49.070 --> 11:50.830
How do you feel, Ayako?

11:50.830 --> 11:52.200
Where’s Mamoru?

11:55.450 --> 11:57.570
It’s OK.

11:58.380 --> 12:02.690
Masaki-san said he detected
Mamoru-kun’s beatrice signal.

12:03.770 --> 12:04.740
Ayako!

12:18.860 --> 12:20.420
Why?

12:20.420 --> 12:23.450
You found his beatrice!

12:23.450 --> 12:25.970
So why don’t you know where he is?!

12:26.600 --> 12:31.100
Mamoru-kun’s beatrice is being deliberately leaked to us.

12:31.100 --> 12:34.100
It shows us that he’s unharmed, I suppose.

12:34.100 --> 12:38.530
But it’s impossible to tell what that old woman’s doing. She’s fought hundreds of battles.

12:38.530 --> 12:42.410
Then bring back my beatrice.

12:42.410 --> 12:45.920
Once I have my power back, I’ll find him myself!

12:46.770 --> 12:50.410
Your beatrice isn’t gone.

12:50.410 --> 12:53.260
It’s simply being put to sleep.

12:53.260 --> 12:58.530
To awaken it, we need to link it
to a more powerful beatrice.

12:58.530 --> 13:00.330
More powerful...

13:00.790 --> 13:04.430
The Return to the Beginning. Right, Masaki?

13:06.770 --> 13:07.810
Look behind you.

13:11.410 --> 13:15.990
We have enough beatrice to activate
the Return to the Beginning.

13:16.640 --> 13:21.520
But just like yours, it’s asleep.

13:22.720 --> 13:30.120
The power within two high-level beatrice users
can be linked on a deep level.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.660
Do something, Masaki!

13:31.660 --> 13:35.500
I can do anything for Mamoru!

13:35.500 --> 13:37.890
Anything?

13:37.890 --> 13:40.640
You won’t to take back those words, Witch Beatrice?

13:40.640 --> 13:42.270
Of course not.

13:42.910 --> 13:45.310
Maya, Emelenzia.

13:45.920 --> 13:48.470
Would you leave for a moment?

13:48.470 --> 13:51.860
Those without power are merely in the way.

13:57.710 --> 14:00.920
Will Witch Beatrice be OK?

14:01.520 --> 14:03.380
Let’s go back to our rooms.

14:03.380 --> 14:06.880
Our worrying here won’t do a thing.

14:07.400 --> 14:10.170
Won’t do a thing?

14:11.640 --> 14:15.840
I’m just like Witch Beatrice.

14:15.840 --> 14:18.880
I can do anything for Mamoru!

14:18.880 --> 14:20.190
But...

14:20.980 --> 14:24.810
You’re telling me that’s just what I wish.
That I really can’t do anything?

14:24.810 --> 14:28.220
Sudou Maya, that’s what you’re telling me?

14:32.660 --> 14:34.120
I’m sorry.

14:36.360 --> 14:37.840
Yeah.

14:37.840 --> 14:39.980
We can do something!

14:40.430 --> 14:43.830
Even we can wait.

14:43.830 --> 14:44.910
Wait...

14:46.180 --> 14:50.530
That’s not the same as doing nothing, is it?

14:50.530 --> 14:52.700
Right, it’s not the same.

14:54.360 --> 14:56.380
Wait... Mamoru...

14:56.880 --> 14:58.940
I’ll wait.

14:58.940 --> 15:02.240
If it’s the one thing I can do.

15:02.750 --> 15:07.140
Mamoru, please... Please be safe!

15:09.760 --> 15:11.940
Hey, Mamoru-kun?

15:11.940 --> 15:13.300
What do you want to do?

15:13.300 --> 15:15.220
Eat?

15:15.220 --> 15:16.130
Have some tea?

15:16.130 --> 15:19.500
Or want to take a bath together?

15:20.470 --> 15:23.210
W-Wait a second.

15:23.210 --> 15:25.040
Why did you kidnap me?

15:26.110 --> 15:28.230
Do you maybe...

15:31.360 --> 15:32.950
Prefer this?

15:32.950 --> 15:36.510
Th-That’s not the problem!

15:36.510 --> 15:38.910
Send me back to Ayako-san...

15:38.910 --> 15:40.100
What?

15:40.100 --> 15:43.100
You like black hair like Witch Beatrice’s?

15:43.100 --> 15:46.000
Then I can change with one of the other girls.

15:46.920 --> 15:50.190
They’re all cute, you know.

15:50.190 --> 15:54.770
Tsune was a valuable member,
but he was just too bright.

15:54.770 --> 15:57.170
So who do you like?

15:57.170 --> 15:59.230
No, that’s...

15:59.680 --> 16:01.500
I know.

16:01.500 --> 16:04.340
You like Witch Beatrice, right?

16:07.580 --> 16:08.810
Fine.

16:08.810 --> 16:10.710
I’ll send you back.

16:10.710 --> 16:13.490
In exchange, I want you to promise me.

16:13.490 --> 16:15.090
Promise?

16:16.440 --> 16:18.460
That you won’t help Masaki.

16:18.460 --> 16:21.030
Help Masaki-san?

16:21.030 --> 16:26.120
The “Return to the Beginning” that he’s
trying his hardest to activate...

16:26.120 --> 16:29.320
It’s a terrifying project that should be abandoned.

16:29.320 --> 16:32.630
That’s the project to make beatrice intelligent, right?

16:32.630 --> 16:37.430
I think it would be fun to talk with them...

16:38.690 --> 16:42.350
But who knows if that intelligence will be good or evil?!

17:00.770 --> 17:02.210
Witch Beatrice...

17:06.640 --> 17:09.640
Witch Beatrice... You’re so beautiful.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.850
Masaki, get started already.

17:29.570 --> 17:30.870
I’m upping the output.

17:35.400 --> 17:38.520
<i>Can you hear it, Witch Beatrice?</i>

17:40.170 --> 17:46.830
<i>You and I are sharing the same pain,
the same suffering.</i>

17:46.830 --> 17:48.200
<i>Stop it.</i>

17:48.200 --> 17:49.820
<i>I’m doing this for Mamoru...</i>

17:49.820 --> 17:52.590
<i>I don’t care who it’s for.</i>

17:52.590 --> 17:54.740
<i>You can feel it, can’t you?</i>

17:54.740 --> 17:56.740
<i>Our beatrice seek one another.</i>

17:56.740 --> 18:00.310
<i>They’re intertwining, mixing, and becoming one.</i>

18:01.800 --> 18:07.570
<i>It will be you and me, not Yoshimura Mamoru,
who awaken the Return to the Beginning.</i>

18:08.170 --> 18:12.590
<i>Mamoru, you’re the only one I want.</i>

18:13.100 --> 18:17.060
<i>Mamoru, please be safe.</i>

18:17.580 --> 18:18.660
<i>Mamoru...</i>

18:19.630 --> 18:20.790
This is good.

18:20.790 --> 18:22.420
The power’s beyond what I’d imagined.

18:22.940 --> 18:25.470
More... Higher!

18:25.470 --> 18:27.660
The beatrice must rise to further heights!

18:29.460 --> 18:30.610
<i>Mamoru...</i>

18:33.840 --> 18:35.820
The beatrice in this world stayed in balance

18:35.820 --> 18:39.340
because we three,
Johan, the Witch Beatrice, and I,

18:39.340 --> 18:43.410
kept each other’s power in check.

18:43.940 --> 18:48.080
If Witch Beatrice helps them,
Masaki and Johan’s research will go faster.

18:48.080 --> 18:51.480
But that’s not a big problem.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.880
I mean, I’m Masaki’s first...

18:55.620 --> 18:56.690
Never mind.

18:57.170 --> 19:02.230
But you change that power balance a little.

19:02.230 --> 19:02.990
I do?

19:03.510 --> 19:07.630
You haven’t realized your own possibilities.

19:07.630 --> 19:09.630
That’s why I’m scared.

19:09.630 --> 19:11.540
That’s why I want you to promise me.

19:13.670 --> 19:16.060
I don’t really understand...

19:16.060 --> 19:20.410
But I can’t imagine the beatrice are that scary.

19:22.350 --> 19:26.610
They’re very kind, and warm,

19:26.610 --> 19:29.310
and it’s Ayako-san who taught me that.

19:29.920 --> 19:36.230
So if she told me to help her, I think I would.

19:36.230 --> 19:38.660
Mamoru-kun, you...

19:38.660 --> 19:45.160
But from what you’ve said, I don’t think she would.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.990
Wouldn’t she?

19:46.990 --> 19:50.690
It’s an attractive project.

19:50.690 --> 19:54.250
As a researcher, she should be interested.

19:54.640 --> 19:57.310
Even if she’s a researcher, she’s still Ayako-san.

19:59.200 --> 20:04.290
If the beatrice would make even
a single person suffer,

20:04.290 --> 20:05.560
I’m sure she would...

20:11.240 --> 20:12.600
Wh-What is this?

20:13.140 --> 20:15.430
The beatrice are screaming...

20:36.680 --> 20:37.590
Finally.

20:37.970 --> 20:40.680
Now, cry out, beatrice!

20:40.680 --> 20:42.550
Let me hear your voice.

20:42.550 --> 20:44.550
What do you seek?

20:44.550 --> 20:46.430
What will you tell us?!

20:52.170 --> 20:53.400
What is this...

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:15.580 --> 23:18.830
Perfect. Flawless. Invincible.

23:18.830 --> 23:24.430
That’s what anyone would think about Ayako-san,

23:24.430 --> 23:27.340
but actually she’s a normal girl.

23:27.340 --> 23:33.850
When she smiles at me, she’s so cute...

23:33.850 --> 23:37.520
And I think to myself, I want to be with her forever.

23:37.520 --> 23:39.440
I love her.

23:40.190 --> 23:42.480
Next time: The Invincible Two.

23:40.570 --> 23:43.980
The Invincible Two
